title: "Alpha Asymmetry in Foreign Exchange Markets: An Investigation of Exploitability"
# Authorship note: Tofik Israfilov is a co-author from v3.1.x onward. The
# published deposits (SSRN 6147567, Zenodo v1.0.0, v2.0.0, v2.0.1 and v3.0.0)
# are sole-authored and stay that way.
#
# Version history (identifiers checked against the Zenodo API, 6 Oct 2026):
#   v1.0.0  deposited 13 Dec 2025 (Zenodo record 17918374) under its own concept
#           DOI, 10.5281/zenodo.17918373; superseded (5.05 tail skew withdrawn).
#   v2.0.0  deposited 14 Feb 2026 (Zenodo record 18638785), first version under
#           the concept DOI below; v2.0.1 followed on 11 Jun 2026.
#   v3.0.0  deposited 11 Jul 2026 (Zenodo record 21315494); its strategy figures
#           came from code whose exit rule did not match the specification.
#   v3.1.0  Tofik Israfilov's correction (PR #2, merged 29 Sep 2026 as ab08f6a):
#           holding rule, execution lag and asymmetry index corrected against
#           the published specification; all downstream results regenerated.
#           Never deposited.
#   v3.1.1  v3.1.0 plus the 6 Oct 2026 corrections on branch polish-oct2026:
#           the return bootstrap and performance statistics exclude the
#           non-executable final week, the execution contrasts and weekend-gap
#           test are pipeline output, and robustness detail moved to appendices.
#           See docs/CORRECTION_CHANGELOG.md.
# Depositing v3.1.1 mints a new Zenodo version DOI under the concept DOI below;
# record it here after publication. The SSRN record needs a separate revision.
